 - Features</title>\n  <style>\n    body, html {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      height: 100%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;\n    }\n    .slide {\n      width: 1440px;\n      height: 810px;\n      background: #000;\n      background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1440\" height=\"810\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 810\"><rect width=\"1440\" height=\"810\" fill=\"black\"/><path d=\"M0,0 L1440,0 L1440,810 L0,810 Z\" fill=\"black\"/><path d=\"M200,200 Q400,50 600,200 T1000,200\" stroke=\"rgba(128,0,255,0.2)\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M300,300 Q500,150 700,300 T1100,300\" stroke=\"rgba(128,0,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M100,400 Q300,250 500,400 T900,400\" stroke=\"rgba(128,0,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>');\n      position: relative;\n      color: white;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .header {\n      height: 80px;\n      background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(128,0,255,0.3);\n    }\n    .footer {\n      height: 80px;\n      background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n      border-top: 1px solid rgba(128,0,255,0.3);\n      margin-top: auto;\n    }\n    .content {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 40px;\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n    .logo {\n      height: 60px;\n      margin: 0 10px;\n    }\n    .title {\n      font-size: 60px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      margin-bottom: 40px;\n      text-align: center;\n      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ffffff, #a64dff);\n      -webkit-background-clip: text;\n      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.3);\n    }\n    .features-content {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 30px;\n    }\n    .features-point {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .bullet {\n      color: #a64dff;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      margin-right: 15px;\n      margin-top: 5px;\n    }\n    .point-text {\n      font-size: 24px;\n      color: white;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .features-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 20px;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    .feature-card {\n      background-color: rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.1);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.5);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      padding: 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n    .feature-icon {\n      width: 50px;\n      height: 50px;\n      background-color: rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.2);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .feature-title {\n      font-size: 20px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #a64dff;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .feature-description {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      color: white;\n      flex-grow: 1;\n    }\n    .feature-tag {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background-color: rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.3);\n      color: white;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      padding: 5px 10px;\n      border-radius: 15px;\n      margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .system-stages {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      background-color: rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.1);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.5);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    .stages-title {\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #a64dff;\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .stages-flow {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    .stage-element {\n      width: 150px;\n      background-color: rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.2);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.5);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 15px;\n    }\n    .stage-title {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: white;\n      margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    .stage-description {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #ccc;\n    }\n    .stage-arrow {\n      width: 40px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: #a64dff;\n      font-size: 24px;\n    }\n    .decoration {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 100px;\n      height: 100px;\n      opacity: 0.5;\n    }\n    .decoration.top-right {\n      top: 100px;\n      right: 100px;\n      transform: rotate(45deg);\n    }\n    .decoration.bottom-left {\n      bottom: 100px;\n      left: 100px;\n      transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"University Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Hack Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"IEEE ComSoc Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"IEEE CTSoc Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"University Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h1 class=\"title\">FEATURES</h1>\n      \n      <div class=\"features-content\">\n        <div class=\"system-stages\">\n          <div class=\"stages-title\">System Operation Breakdown</div>\n          <div class=\"stages-flow\">\n            <div class=\"stage-element\">\n              <div class=\"stage-title\">Data Collection</div>\n              <div class=\"stage-description\">Sensors monitor soil conditions and environmental factors</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stage-arrow\">→</div>\n            <div class=\"stage-element\">\n              <div class=\"stage-title\">Analysis</div>\n              <div class=\"stage-description\">AI processes data to identify patterns and needs</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stage-arrow\">→</div>\n            <div class=\"stage-element\">\n              <div class=\"stage-title\">Recommendation</div>\n              <div class=\"stage-description\">System generates actionable insights</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stage-arrow\">→</div>\n            <div class=\"stage-element\">\n              <div class=\"stage-title\">Action</div>\n              <div class=\"stage-description\">Farmer implements or automates recommended actions</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"features-point\">\n          <div class=\"bullet\">•</div>\n          <div class=\"point-text\">List the standout features and functionalities that address the identified problem.</div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"features-grid\">\n          <div class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                <path d=\"M20.5 3l-.16.03L15 5.1 9 3 3.36 4.9c-.21.07-.36.25-.36.48V20.5c0 .28.22.5.5.5l.16-.03L9 18.9l6 2.1 5.64-1.9c.21-.07.36-.25.36-.48V3.5c0-.28-.22-.5-.5-.5zM15 19l-6-2.11V5l6 2.11V19z\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-title\">Farm Mapping & Zoning</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-description\">Interactive digital representation of farmland with zone-specific management capabilities, enabling targeted interventions</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-tag\">Core Feature</div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-title\">Real-time Soil Monitoring</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-description\">Continuous tracking of moisture, nutrients, and pH levels across farm zones through integrated sensor network</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-tag\">Sensor-Based USP</div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                <path d=\"M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zM9 17H7v-7h2v7zm4 0h-2V7h2v10zm4 0h-2v-4h2v4z\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-title\">AI Crop Recommendations</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-description\">Data-driven planting advice based on soil conditions, weather patterns, and market trends for optimal crop selection</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-tag\">AI-Powered</div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                <path d=\"M12 2C6.49 2 2 6.49 2 12s4.49 10 10 10 10-4.49 10-10S17.51 2 12 2zm0 18c-4.41 0-8-3.59-8-8s3.59-8 8-8 8 3.59 8 8-3.59 8-8 8zm3-8c0 1.66-1.34 3-3 3s-3-1.34-3-3 1.34-3 3-3 3 1.34 3 3z\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-title\">Remote Equipment Control</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-description\">Control irrigation systems, motors, and valves directly from the app, enabling precision resource management</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-tag\">Sensor-Based USP</div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                <path d=\"M21.11 2.89L21.11 2.89c-.46-.46-1.11-.78-1.81-.78h-1.2c-.67 0-1.35.33-1.81.8L14 5.12l-4.24.35L8.51 2.2C8.19 1.29 7.21 1 6.5 1c-.66 0-1.3.27-1.77.76L3.9 2.6c-.92.95-.92 2.47.02 3.42l1.63 1.6L2 10.12l3.37 3.37c.2.2.51.2.71 0l1.62-1.61 1.62 1.61c.2.2.51.2.71 0l3.36-3.36 2.12 2.12c.2.2.51.2.71 0l5.62-5.62c.47-.47.78-1.13.78-1.82v-1.19c0-.68-.27-1.34-.77-1.82zM18 6c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1s.45-1 1-1 1 .45 1 1-.45 1-1 1zM5.04 15.15l-1.79 1.79c-.2.2-.51.2-.71 0l-1.79-1.79c-.2-.2-.2-.51 0-.71l1.79-1.79c.2-.2.51-.2.71 0l1.79 1.79c.2.2.2.51 0 .71zM12 10.12l-3.35 3.35c-.2.2-.51.2-.71 0l-1.62-1.62-1.62 1.62c-.2.2-.51.2-.71 0l-3.36-3.36 3.55-3.55c.2-.2.51-.2.71 0l1.62 1.62 1.62-1.62c.2-.2.51-.2.71 0l2.99 2.98.17.17z\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-title\">Predictive Disease & Pest Detection</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-description\">Early identification of potential crop health issues before visible symptoms appear, using sensor data patterns</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-tag\">AI-Powered</div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"feature-icon\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                <path d=\"M21 18v1c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H5c-1.11 0-2-.9-2-2V5c0-1.1.89-2 2-2h14c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v1h-9c-1.11 0-2 .9-2 2v8c0 1.1.89 2 2 2h9zm-9-2h10V8H12v8zm4-2.5c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5s.67-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5.67 1.5 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5 1.5z\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-title\">Market Price Tracking</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-description\">Real-time commodity prices to optimize selling decisions and timing, maximizing farmer profits</div>\n            <div class=\"feature-tag\">Market Intelligence</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAxMDAgMTAwIj48cG9seWdvbiBwb2ludHM9IjUwLDEwIDkwLDUwIDUwLDkwIDEwLDUwIiBmaWxsPSJub25lIiBzdHJva2U9IiNhNjRkZmYiIHN0cm9rZS13aWR0aD0iMyIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" alt=\"Decoration\" class=\"decoration top-right\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAxMDAgMTAwIj48cG9seWdvbiBwb2ludHM9IjUwLDEwIDkwLDUwIDUwLDkwIDEwLDUwIiBmaWxsPSJub25lIiBzdHJva2U9IiNhNjRkZmYiIHN0cm9rZS13aWR0aD0iMyIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" alt=\"Decoration\" class=\"decoration bottom-left\">\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"University Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Hack Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"IEEE ComSoc Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"IEEE CTSoc Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"University Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},{"id":"target_audience","path":"/home/ubuntu/sfe_comsoc_hackx_presentation/target_audience.html","changed":true,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Smart Farming Ecosystem - Target Audience and Market Scope</title>\n  <style>\n    body, html {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      height: 100%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;\n    }\n    .slide {\n      width: 1440px;\n      height: 810px;\n      background: #000;\n      background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1440\" height=\"810\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 810\"><rect width=\"1440\" height=\"810\" fill=\"black\"/><path d=\"M0,0 L1440,0 L1440,810 L0,810 Z\" fill=\"black\"/><path d=\"M200,200 Q400,50 600,200 T1000,200\" stroke=\"rgba(128,0,255,0.2)\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M300,300 Q500,150 700,300 T1100,300\" stroke=\"rgba(128,0,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M100,400 Q300,250 500,400 T900,400\" stroke=\"rgba(128,0,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>');\n      position: relative;\n      color: white;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .header {\n      height: 80px;\n      background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(128,0,255,0.3);\n    }\n    .footer {\n      height: 80px;\n      background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n      border-top: 1px solid rgba(128,0,255,0.3);\n      margin-top: auto;\n    }\n    .content {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 40px;\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n    .logo {\n      height: 60px;\n      margin: 0 10px;\n    }\n    .title {\n      font-size: 60px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      margin-bottom: 40px;\n      text-align: center;\n      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ffffff, #a64dff);\n      -webkit-background-clip: text;\n      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.3);\n    }\n    .audience-content {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 30px;\n    }\n    .audience-point {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .bullet {\n      color: #a64dff;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      margin-right: 15px;\n      margin-top: 5px;\n    }\n    .point-text {\n      font-size: 24px;\n      color: white;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .audience-segments {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .segment-card {\n      background-color: rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.1);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.5);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      padding: 20px;\n      width: 30%;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .segment-icon {\n      width: 60px;\n      height: 60px;\n      background-color: rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.2);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin: 0 auto 15px;\n    }\n    .segment-title {\n      font-size: 20px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #a64dff;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .segment-description {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      color: white;\n    }\n    .market-stats {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    .stat-box {\n      background-color: rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.1);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.5);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      padding: 15px;\n      width: 22%;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .stat-number {\n      font-size: 28px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #a64dff;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .stat-description {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: white;\n    }\n    .value-proposition {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      background-color: rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.1);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.5);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    .value-title {\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #a64dff;\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .value-points {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n    .value-item {\n      width: 23%;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .value-icon {\n      width: 40px;\n      height: 40px;\n      background-color: rgba(166, 77, 255, 0.2);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin: 0 auto 10px;\n    }\n    .value-label {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: white;\n    }\n    .decoration {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 100px;\n      height: 100px;\n      opacity: 0.5;\n    }\n    .decoration.top-right {\n      top: 100px;\n      right: 100px;\n      transform: rotate(45deg);\n    }\n    .decoration.bottom-left {\n      bottom: 100px;\n      left: 100px;\n      transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"University Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Hack Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"IEEE ComSoc Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"IEEE CTSoc Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"University Logo\" class=\"logo\">\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h1 class=\"title\">TARGET AUDIENCE AND MARKET SCOPE</h1>\n      \n      <div class=\"audience-content\">\n        <div class=\"audience-point\">\n          <div class=\"bullet\">•</div>\n          <div class=\"point-text\">Define your target users or beneficiaries.</div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"audience-segments\">\n          <div class=\"segment-card\">\n            <div class=\"segment-icon\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                <path d=\"M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"segment-title\">Primary</div>\n            <div class=\"segment-description\">Small and medium-scale farmers (1-50 acres) seeking to optimize yields and reduce resource waste</div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"segment-card\">\n            <div class=\"segment-icon\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                <path d=\"M16 11c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S17.66 5 16 5c-1.66 0-3 1.34-3 3s1.34 3 3 3zm-8 0c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S9.66 5 8 5C6.34 5 5 6.34 5 8s1.34 3 3 3zm0 2c-2.33 0-7 1.17-7 3.5V19h14v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5zm8 0c-.29 0-.62.02-.97.05 1.16.84 1.97 1.97 1.97 3.45V19h6v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5z\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"segment-title\">Secondary</div>\n            <div class=\"segment-description\">Agricultural cooperatives and farming communities looking for collective technological solutions</div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"segment-card\">\n            <div class=\"segment-icon\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                <path d=\"M20 6h-4V4c0-1.11-.89-2-2-2h-4c-1.11 0-2 .89-2 2v2H4c-1.11 0-1.99.89-1.99 2L2 19c0 1.11.89 2 2 2h16c1.11 0 2-.89 2-2V8c0-1.11-.89-2-2-2zm-6 0h-4V4h4v2z\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"segment-title\">Tertiary</div>\n            <div class=\"segment-description\">Agricultural extension services and advisors who support multiple farmers with technical guidance</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"audience-point\">\n          <div class=\"bullet\">•</div>\n          <div class=\"point-text\">Analyze the market opportunity, demand potential, and the value your solution delivers at scale.</div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"market-stats\">\n          <div class=\"stat-box\">\n            <div class=\"stat-number\">$12.9B</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-description\">Global precision agriculture market projected by 2027</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-box\">\n            <div class=\"stat-number\">570M+</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-description\">Farms worldwide, majority being small-scale operations</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-box\">\n            <div class=\"stat-number\">15-20%</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-description\">Potential yield increase with precision agriculture</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-box\">\n            <div class=\"stat-number\">30%</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-description\">Potential resource reduction (water, fertilizer, pesticides)</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"value-proposition\">\n          <div class=\"value-title\">Value Proposition at Scale</div>\n          <div class=\"value-points\">\n            <div class=\"value-item\">\n              <div class=\"value-icon\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                  <path d=\"M16 6l2.29 2.29-4.88 4.88-4-4L2 16.59 3.41 18l6-6 4 4 6.3-6.29L22 12V6z\"/>\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"value-label\">Increased Yields</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"value-item\">\n              <div class=\"value-icon\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                  <path d=\"M11.8 10.9c-2.27-.59-3-1.2-3-2.15 0-1.09 1.01-1.85 2.7-1.85 1.78 0 2.44.85 2.5 2.1h2.21c-.07-1.72-1.12-3.3-3.21-3.81V3h-3v2.16c-1.94.42-3.5 1.68-3.5 3.61 0 2.31 1.91 3.46 4.7 4.13 2.5.6 3 1.48 3 2.41 0 .69-.49 1.79-2.7 1.79-2.06 0-2.87-.92-2.98-2.1h-2.2c.12 2.19 1.76 3.42 3.68 3.83V21h3v-2.15c1.95-.37 3.5-1.5 3.5-3.55 0-2.84-2.43-3.81-4.7-4.4z\"/>\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"value-label\">Reduced Costs</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"value-item\">\n              <div class=\"value-icon\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                  <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z\"/>\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"value-label\">Environmental Sustainability</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"value-item\">\n              <div class=\"value-icon\">\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a64dff\">\n                  <path d=\"M3 13h2v-2H3v2zm0 4h2v-2H3v2zm0-8h2V7H3v2zm4 4h14v-2H7v2zm0 4h14v-2H7v2zM7 7v2h14V7H7z\"/>\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"value-label\">Simplified Management</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5